{"id":"99c92f3457aacd12","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-literal.md","title":"Boolean literal","display":"df-literal — Boolean literal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-literal","aliases":["27-df-literal"],"display":"df-literal — Boolean literal","depends_on":["[[27-df-vardom]]","[[27-df-boolfunc]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§1.4 Definition 1.10","source_printed_pages":"15","source_pdf_pages":"39","verification_status":"source-statement-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-literal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-literal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-literal — Boolean literal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4b84ee77aaf0c828\" href=\"?note=4b84ee77aaf0c828\" title=\"27-df-vardom\">27-df-vardom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5d10aed668d85817\" href=\"?note=5d10aed668d85817\" title=\"27-df-boolfunc\">27-df-boolfunc</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§1.4 Definition 1.10"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"15"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"39"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B^n\">\\(\\mathbb B^n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]\">\\([n]\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4b84ee77aaf0c828\" href=\"?note=4b84ee77aaf0c828\" title=\"27-df-vardom\">27-df-vardom</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5d10aed668d85817\" href=\"?note=5d10aed668d85817\" title=\"27-df-boolfunc\">27-df-boolfunc</a>。投影文字与补文字仅对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in[n]\">\\(i\\in[n]\\)</span> 构造；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lit}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Lit}_n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConsLit}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{ConsLit}_n\\)</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 构造。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"x_i\\coloneqq\\{(a,a_i)\\mid a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\},\\qquad\\bar x_i\\coloneqq\\{(a,1-a_i)\\mid a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\}\\quad(i\\in[n]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[x_i\\coloneqq\\{(a,a_i)\\mid a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\},\\qquad\\bar x_i\\coloneqq\\{(a,1-a_i)\\mid a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\}\\quad(i\\in[n]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lit}_n\\coloneqq\\{x_i\\mid i\\in[n]\\}\\cup\\{\\bar x_i\\mid i\\in[n]\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Lit}_n\\coloneqq\\{x_i\\mid i\\in[n]\\}\\cup\\{\\bar x_i\\mid i\\in[n]\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\overline{x_i}\\coloneqq\\bar x_i,\\qquad\\overline{\\bar x_i}\\coloneqq x_i\\quad(i\\in[n]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\overline{x_i}\\coloneqq\\bar x_i,\\qquad\\overline{\\bar x_i}\\coloneqq x_i\\quad(i\\in[n]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConsLit}_n\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\mathrm{Lit}_n\\mid\\forall i\\in[n]\\;(\\{x_i,\\bar x_i\\}\\nsubseteq L)\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{Lit}_0=\\varnothing,\\qquad\\mathrm{ConsLit}_0=\\{\\varnothing\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ConsLit}_n\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\mathrm{Lit}_n\\mid\\forall i\\in[n]\\;(\\{x_i,\\bar x_i\\}\\nsubseteq L)\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{Lit}_0=\\varnothing,\\qquad\\mathrm{ConsLit}_0=\\{\\varnothing\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"x_i,\\bar x_i\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\quad(i\\in[n]),\\qquad\\mathrm{Lit}_n\\subseteq\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[x_i,\\bar x_i\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\quad(i\\in[n]),\\qquad\\mathrm{Lit}_n\\subseteq\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>文字在本目录表示为投影函数及其补；其作为表达式叶子的语法标签在 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f3101a1c9df92f67\" href=\"?note=f3101a1c9df92f67\" title=\"27-df-boolexpr\">27-df-boolexpr</a> 中另行构造。一致文字集不含互补对。坐标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 只在对应公式内量化，因而零元时仍定义文字载体与一致文字集；不会因要求选出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in[0]\">\\(i\\in[0]\\)</span> 而使整个定义不可实例化。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target"