leq2)$；子句和文字补见 [[27-df-clause]]、[[27-df-literal]]。$E_C$ 与 $\\mathrm{ImpGraph}(C)$ 由下式构造；$\\mathrm{Reach}_{E_C}$ 是 $\\mathrm{Lit}_n$ 上的二元谓词，路径采用指标集 $\\{0,\\ldots,r\\}$。"},{"id":"8311e93eaac6c631","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$L\\in\\mathrm{ConsLit}_n$，$T_L\\in\\mathrm{Term}_n$；一致文字集及其对应项见 [[27-df-term]] 及其上游 [[27-df-literal]]。"},{"id":"e065076d6b51508e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$L\\in\\mathrm{ConsLit}_n$；文字及一致文字集见 [[27-df-literal]]。"},{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-254","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-literal|df-literal — Boolean literal]]"},{"id":"1e9aa7b3ae40ed8b","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$L\\subseteq\\mathrm{Lit}_n$ 是任意文字集；$\\mathrm{Lit}_n$ 见 [[27-df-literal]]，$\\mathbf1_n$ 见 [[27-df-constfunc]]。"},{"id":"ef0fa09ed6f07d44","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"$L\\in\\mathrm{ConsLit}_n$，$\\mathrm{ConsLit}_n$、$T_L$ 分别见 [[27-df-literal]]、[[27-df-term]]。"},{"id":"1ad4ae22be339cdc","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PureQuad}_n$，$\\mathrm{PI}$、$\\mathrm{Lits}$ 取 [[27-df-purelyquadratic]] 的含义；$\\mathrm{Dual}_n$ 见 [[27-df-dual]]。$\\mathrm{ConsLit}_n$ 是 [[27-df-literal]] 中正式定义的一致文字集族。"},{"id":"76d402e4544e2209","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$D\\in\\mathrm{QuadDNF}_n$，$f=\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)$，$\\exists a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(a)=0)$；$C_D$ 为 [[27-thm-quadforcedliterals]] 中从 $D$ 构造的 $2$-CNF。$\\mathrm{PI},\\mathrm{Lits}$ 见 [[27-thm-quadprime]]；$\\mathrm{Lit}_n,\\mathrm{ConsLit}_n$ 见 [[27-df-literal]]，$\\mathrm{Reach}_{E_{C_D}}$ 见 [[27-df-implgraph]]。$L_1$ 由下式定义。"}],"outgoing":["4b84ee77aaf0c828","5d10aed668d85817","f3101a1c9df92f67"]}